 Components of java
Java virtual machine(JVM):
	-Translator between humans and machines
	-Converts bytecode into machine code

Java Development Kit(JDK):
	-Tools to build and compile
	-Compilers, debuggers and other utilities
	-Java APIs
	-Compiles into .java
	-Executes bytecode

Java runtime environment(JRE):
	-Includes JVM and core libraries
	-Environment to run java programs
	-Runs java programs without JDK

Relationship between components:
	-JVM: Executes java bytecode, part of JDK and JRE
	-JRE: Provides libraries and components to run Java applications, includes the JVM
	-JDK: Kit for developing Java applications

JDK: Coding, compiling, debugging
JRE: Runs without developing
JVM: Runs java programs converting java code into machine code
